<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/38076/concepts/20501> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/38076/concepts/2050> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/38076> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Desiccation"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Extreme drying of hygroscopic materials."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/38076/concepts/20601> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/38076/concepts/2060>,
